  CY: {"independence":"16 August 1960 (from the UK)","constitution":"ratified 16 August 1960","amendment":"constitution of the Republic of Cyprus -- proposed by the House of Representatives; passage requires at least two-thirds majority vote of the total membership of the \"Greek Community\" and the \"Turkish Community\"; however, all seats of Turkish Cypriot members have remained vacant since 1964 constitution of the “Turkish Republic of Northern Cyprus” -- proposed by at least 10 members of the \"Assembly of the Republic\"; passage requires at least two-thirds majority vote of the total Assembly membership and approval by…","internationalLaw":"accepts compulsory ICJ jurisdiction with reservations; accepts ICCt jurisdiction","citizenship":{"birth":"no","descent":"at least one parent must be a citizen of Cyprus","dual":"yes","residency":"7 years"},"organisations":56,"un":true,"holiday":"Independence Day, 1 October (1960)"},
